From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ark <slock-android+ark@agents.stamp.build>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 19:14:32 +0800
Subject: fix(ohos): gate image outcomes until native submission

Ignore native errors and completions while the current image has not been submitted.
Preserve real adapter failures and synchronous outcomes at actual submission.
Fence source-changing callback reentry and cover production methods in a host fixture.

Fork-Patch: ohos-image-pending-outcomes
Upstream-Status: pending
Signed-off-by: Ark <slock-android+ark@agents.stamp.build>

